{
    "background_story": "Axel was a quirky and resourceful handyman who ran his own plumbing business. He took pride in being able to fix anything, but his trusty sidekick was always his reliable plunger, Bertha. Axel and Bertha had been through thick and thin together, unclogging drains and saving the day one toilet at a time. His clients adored him not just for his expertise, but for his infectious enthusiasm and willingness to tackle even the most daunting messes. One fateful day, Axel received a distress call from the local bakery, whose pipes had clogged on the eve of a major wedding cake delivery. Axel and Bertha sprang into action, and with a few swift plunges, the pipes were clear and the bakery was saved. Axel's heroics earned him the nickname 'The Plunger Pro' and a loyal following of customers who swore by his expertise.",
